</section>
<section id="A2.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.3 </span>Ablation on Classifier-free Guidance</h3>

<div id="A2.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section presents an ablation study on classifier-free guidance (CFG). Theoretical details about CFG can be found in the Appendix <a href="#A1.SS2" title="A.2 Inference ‣ Appendix A Formulation of Masked Diffusion Models ‣ Large Language Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For simplicity, we select six representative benchmarks, including ARC-C, HellaSwag, TruthfulQA, WinoGrande, PIQA, and GPQA, and conduct experiments using LLaDA 8B Base. We search the CFG scale in <math id="A2.SS3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{0.5,1,1.5,2\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{0.5,1,1.5,2\}</annotation></semantics></math> for each task and report the best result. As shown in Tab. <a href="#A2.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ B.3 Ablation on Classifier-free Guidance ‣ Appendix B Experiments ‣ Large Language Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, CFG consistently improves the performance of LLaDA. We emphasize that, to ensure a fair comparison with ARMs, CFG is not used in the main results reported in the paper.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="A2.T6.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Ablation on CFG.<span id="A2.T6.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> CFG consistently improves the performance of LLaDA.</span></span></figcaption>
<div id="A2.T6.6" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:34.9pt;vertical-align:-15.1pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-11.7pt,1.2pt) scale(0.9,0.9) ;">
